{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.82] Yeah, we're laying in bed\n[00:06.04] You see the—\n[00:08.08] Eyes lock, eyes, our eyes lock\n[Chorus]\n[00:15.60] Our eyes locked, you can see the sadness\n[00:19.66] My heart stops, every time you call my name\n[00:23.48] My jaw drops, you fell from the stars, and I'm starstruck\n[00:29.68] You fell from the stars, girl, am I lost?\n[00:32.20] When you're down, when you're sad, is it my fault?\n[00:37.30] I apologize for all of the lies, oh\n[00:42.20] I won't treat you like the rest of them guys, oh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.72] I'm off the Percs, she don't condone it\n[00:49.66] You say it makes me act atrocious\n[00:51.70] But I can't stand life when I'm sober\n[00:53.68] Take my heart, I'll hand it over\n[00:55.68] Six months in, it gets colder\n[00:57.84] I don't want us to be over\n[00:59.64] Let's make love 'til we die\n[01:01.46] And let's fuck until we slump over\n[01:04.00] Be my first aid, I know that you hate to see me bleed\n[01:07.66] I don't deserve your love, I tend to fuck up everything\n[01:11.24] It feels like I'm not enough, 'nough, 'nough, no\n[01:14.88] This a conversation, not a love song\n[Chorus]\n[01:18.66] Our eyes locked, you can see the sadness\n[01:23.24] My heart stops, every time you call my name\n[01:27.38] My jaw drops, you fell from the stars and I'm starstruck\n[01:32.64] You fell from the stars, girl, am I lost?\n[01:37.04] When you're down, when you're sad, is it my fault?\n[01:41.68] I apologize for all of the lies, oh\n[01:45.16] I won't treat you like the rest of them guys, oh\n[Verse 2]\n[01:50.50] I wanna know, is it gon' be forever, or temporary?\n[01:53.40] If you leave, it'll hurt, keep the tissue ready\n[01:55.44] Got the drugs on the table, I'm ready\n[01:57.34] I put Rick on your slippers, no Cinderella\n[01:59.54] Remember when you went to the fortune teller\n[02:01.56] She told you, we \"need each other\"\n[02:03.56] Ha, what if she trippin? I'm just kiddin'\n[02:06.02] Back to the main focus, I think that you're gorgeous\n[02:10.00] You love the way that I stroke it, signin' my name on your neck\n[02:13.94] You used to make potions, playin' round with witchcraft\n[02:17.74] I wonder if you'll put that in my lean and I'll drink that\n[Chorus]\n[02:20.78] Our eyes locked, you can see the sadness\n[02:23.74] My heart stops, every time you call my name\n[02:30.36] My jaw drops, you fell from the stars and I'm starstruck\n[02:35.58] You fell from the stars, girl, am I lost?\n[02:38.16] When you're down, when you're sad, is it my fault?\n[02:43.24] I apologize for all of the lies, oh\n[02:48.10] I won't treat you like the rest of them guys, oh\n[Bridge]\n[02:54.22] We met in a Twilight Zone\n[02:57.58] I fall apart but she keep me whole\n[03:02.08] We met on the West Coast\n[03:05.56] But I still see Miami in your soul\n[Chorus]\n[03:09.58] Our eyes locked, you can see the sadness\n[03:13.36] My heart stops, every time you call my name\n[03:17.00] My jaw drops, you fell from the stars and I'm starstruck\n[03:22.78] You fell from the stars, girl, am I lost?\n[03:25.42] When you're down, when you're sad, is it my fault?\n[03:30.36] I apologize for all of the lies, oh\n[03:35.32] I won't treat you like the rest of them guys, oh\n[Outro]\n[03:48.80] I'm here to serve a purpose\n[03:50.24] Girl, I know I ain't picture-perfect\n[03:52.28] One more thing I know for certain\n[03:54.16] If you leave, I'll close the curtains","words":[[0.62,0.74,"[Intro]"],[0.76,0.78,"[00:00.82]"],[0.82,2.1,"Yeah,"],[2.14,2.66,"we're"],[4.02,4.56,"laying"],[4.6,4.68,"in"],[4.76,5.02,"bed"],[5.04,5.86,"[00:06.04]"],[6.04,6.12,"You"],[6.32,6.54,"see"],[6.64,6.7,"the—"],[6.72,7.28,"[00:08.08]"],[8.08,8.94,"Eyes"],[9.0,9.26,"lock,"],[10.04,10.66,"eyes,"],[11.52,11.72,"our"],[12.52,12.78,"eyes"],[12.92,13.22,"lock"],[15.36,15.5,"[Chorus]"],[15.52,15.54,"[00:15.60]"],[15.6,15.68,"Our"],[16.46,16.7,"eyes"],[16.86,17.18,"locked,"],[17.84,17.92,"you"],[18.02,18.18,"can"],[18.3,18.46,"see"],